DEF BSTAT0_SLEEP_TURNS_LO EQU 2 ; low bit of a 2-bit sleep counter: ActionEffect_Sleep sets bits 7, 3 and 2 together (or $8C); ActionEffect_ActionBF tests bits 2-3 ($0C) (E-0346 reading, C1)
