DEF BSTAT2_TAKE_MAGIC EQU 0 ; set and tested by ActionEffect_TakeMagic; the AI checks it before TakeMagic (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT2_BOUNCE EQU 1 ; a lasting spell bounce: TryWallOfLightBounce bounces when bit 1 or 5 is set ($22) and keeps bit 5 only when bit 1 is set; ChooseTarget_Beat, _Sap and _Slow skip targets with it (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT2_DAMAGE_HALVED EQU 2 ; HalveDamageIfTargetStatus2Bit2 halves the damage to a target with it (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT2_AQUA_WALL EQU 3 ; set by AquaWall
DEF BSTAT2_UNUSED_2_4 EQU 4 ; no static reader or writer found (bit/set/res on the status byte, masks after AddAx9ToHL); forcing it showed no new battle text (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT2_MAGIC_BACK EQU 5 ; a one-time spell bounce: TryWallOfLightBounce clears it after bouncing unless bit 1 is set; tested by ActionEffect_MagicBack (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT2_WIND_GUARD EQU 6 ; set by TailWind; TryWindBounce: 'The wind around 0 bounced the attack!', DeMagic: 'The wind around 0 died!' (E-0337)
DEF BSTAT2_CRITICAL_ROLLED EQU 7 ; ResolveStepChanceRoll sets it on the actor when the critical roll succeeds ('Critical hit!' / 'A brutal hit!') and clears it otherwise; ResolveStepComputeDamage then uses ATK within 5% as the damage; Berserker, EvilSlash, Massacre and TwinSlash clear it (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT3_FROZEN EQU 0 ; forced: '0 is frozen solid!'
DEF BSTAT3_DANCING EQU 1 ; forced: '0 is dancing along!'
DEF BSTAT3_TRIPPED EQU 2 ; forced: '0 can't get back up!'
DEF BSTAT3_SHIVERING EQU 3 ; forced: '0 is shivering!'
DEF BSTAT3_COWERING EQU 4 ; forced: '0 is cowering in fear!'
DEF BSTAT3_VACANT EQU 5 ; forced: '0 looks vacant and lost!'
DEF BSTAT3_AIRBORNE EQU 6 ; forced: '0 fell out of the sky!', '0 landed safely!'
DEF BSTAT3_AIRBORNE_HI EQU 7 ; high bit of a 2-bit field with AIRBORNE (byte 3 is tested with and $C0 in about 40 places; ActionEffect_ActionC9 and _ActionBF clear both); forced: 'But it failed to reach 0!', '0 fell out of the sky!', '0 landed awkwardly!' (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT4_CHARGE_UP EQU 0 ; set (with bit 1) by ChargeUp
DEF BSTAT4_CHARGE_UP_HI EQU 1 ; set with bit 0 by ActionEffect_ChargeUp (or $03); ActorLacksStatus4Bits01 tests both (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT4_HIGH_JUMP EQU 2 ; ForcedActionForActorStatus forces action $CC (HighJump) when it is set; SetSubPhase2AndRestartResolve clears bits 2-3 for action $CC when they equal 1; forced: 'But it failed to reach 0!' (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT4_HIGH_JUMP_HI EQU 3 ; high bit of the 2-bit field with HIGH_JUMP ($0C, cleared by TryShuntOrGuard and ActionEffect_ActionC9); forced: '0 fell out of the sky!', 'But it failed to reach 0!' (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT4_SUCK_AIR EQU 4 ; set (with bit 5) by SuckAir
DEF BSTAT4_SUCK_AIR_HI EQU 5 ; set with bit 4 by ActionEffect_SuckAir (or $30); ActorLacksStatus4Bits45 tests both (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT4_FOCUS_LO EQU 6 ; low bit of the 2-bit field with FOCUS (ActorLacksStatus4Bits67 tests $C0); RunBattleActions tests and clears it when the actor's action starts (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT4_FOCUS EQU 7 ; set by Focus
DEF BSTAT5_RADIANT_BLIND EQU 0 ; ActionEffect_Radiant (D = 1) has no effect on a target with it, and ORs D into this byte when it blinds; the AI tests it with BLINDED (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT5_SANDSTORM_BLIND EQU 1 ; ActionEffect_SandStorm (D = 2) has no effect on a target with it, and ORs D into this byte when it blinds (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT5_SIDE_STEP EQU 2 ; the SideStep field (bits 2-3, and $0C, tested by the AI before SideStep); cleared by ClearTargetStatus5Bits23And7Bits012 (WarCry, Ahhh, LegSweep ...); forced: '0 leapt out of the way!' (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT5_SIDE_STEP_HI EQU 3 ; high bit of the SideStep field; forced: '0 leapt out of the way!' (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT5_SONG_FORCED EQU 4 ; ForcedActionForActorStatus forces action $CE when it is set; ActionEffect_LifeSong takes its second path when it is set and otherwise starts the song (LIFE_SONG) (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT5_LIFE_SONG EQU 5 ; forced: '0's song ended!', '0 came back to life!'
DEF BSTAT5_IRONIZED EQU 6 ; forced: '0 is a hunk of iron!', '0's Ironize wore off!' (bit 7 the same)
