DEF BSTAT7_COUNTER EQU 2 ; forced: '0's counterstrike!', '0 couldn't retaliate!'
DEF BSTAT7_DAMAGE_DOUBLED EQU 3 ; the reaction step doubles the damage to a target with it (E-0346 reading, C1)
