DEF BSTAT7_UNUSED_7_5 EQU 5 ; no static reader or writer found; forcing it showed no new battle text (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT7_UNUSED_7_6 EQU 6 ; no static reader or writer found; forcing it showed no new battle text (E-0346 reading, C1)
DEF BSTAT7_UNUSED_7_7 EQU 7 ; no static reader or writer found; forcing it showed no new battle text (E-0346 reading, C1)
